    "chunk_text": "t he worhte. And gif gegilda his gegildan \u00feurh his agen dysi ofstlea, bere sylf wi\u00fe magas \u00fe\u00e6t he br\u00e6c, & his gegilde And gif gegilda myd \u00fe\u00e6m ete o\u00f0\u00f0e drince \u00fee his gegildan stlog, butun hit beforan cyninge, o\u00f0\u00f0e Gif hwilc gegilda o\u00feerne misgrete, gylde anne syster huniges. And gif hwa o\u00feerne misgrete, gylde anne syster huniges butun he hine mid his twam gesetlun geladie. Gif cniht w\u00e6pn brede, gilde se hlaford an pund, & h\u00e6bbe se hlaford \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t he m\u00e6ge. And him eal gildscipe gefylste \u00fe\u00e6t he his feoh of h\u00e6bbe. And gif cniht o\u00feerne gewundie, wrece hit hlaford, & eal gyldscipe on, & sece \u00fe\u00e6t he sece, \u00fe\u00e6t he feorh And gif cniht binnan stig sitte, gylde anne syster huniges. And gif hwa fotsetlan h\u00e6bbe do \u00fe\u00e6t ylce. And gif hwilc gegilda ut of lande for\u00f0fere, o\u00f0\u00f0e beo gesycled, gefeccan hine his gegildan. And hine gebringan deadne o\u00f0\u00f0e cucene \u00fe\u00e6r he to wilnie. Be \u00fe\u00e6m ylcan wyte \u00fee hit gecweden is. Gif he \u00e6t ham for\u00f0fer\u00f0 & gegilda \u00fe\u00e6t lic ne gesec\u00f0. & se gegilda \u00fee ne gesece his..",
